  "bodyHtml": "\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-image-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-title-date no-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Labor Day Silent Auction of Vivien Oswell Paintings &amp; Prints</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tecset-date\"><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">September 4, 2023 @ 10:00 am</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">4:00 pm</span></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-light-bg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-content-area\">\n\t\t   \t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>A silent auction of several paintings and prints by <strong>local artist Vivien Oswell</strong> will be held as part of th<img class=\"wp-image-6581 alignleft\" src=\"/media/archive/22c62af270b7ca2cb8a5223a6a8886e7398150ebf8e72eae5a0918341c2a99fd.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"232\" loading=\"lazy\" />e</p>\n<p>Vivien, who turned 100 years old in June, was still producing oil commissions as recently as last fall. She is a co-founding member, along with Georgia Dearborn, of the Guild of Harwich Artists when in late 1970’s they began selling their art in Doane Park. The silent auction will run from 10am to 4pm; one need not be present to win. Proceeds will help fund a commemorative bench in the park.</p>\n<p>Art-in-the-Park, now in its 43<sup>rd</sup> year, runs every Monday, 11am to 4pm, (weather permitting) till September 18<sup>th</sup>.  Art works for sale include fine arts and juried crafts. The park is pet-friendly. Ample parking next door at Post Office Square.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-map-area\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-venue-map\">\n\t\n<p data-fidelity-note=\"embed\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyDNsicAsP6-VuGtAb1O9riI3oc_NOb7IOU&amp;q=10+Post+Office+Square+Harwich+Port+MA+MA+02646+United+States+&amp;zoom=10\">Google maps iframe displaying the address to Doane Park, Harwich Port</a></p>\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-area\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-past-event-notice\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-notices\"><ul><li>This event has passed.</li></ul></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-details\">\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Details </h2>\n\t<ul class=\"tribe-events-meta-list\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-meta-item\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-start-date-label tribe-events-meta-label\">Date:</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<abbr class=\"tribe-events-abbr tribe-events-start-date published dtstart\" title=\"2023-09-04\"> September 4, 2023 </abbr>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</li>\n\n\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-meta-item\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-start-time-label tribe-events-meta-label\">Time:</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-abbr tribe-events-start-time published dtstart\" title=\"2023-09-04\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t10:00 am - 4:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</li>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-meta-item\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-event-cost-label tribe-events-meta-label\">Cost:</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-event-cost tribe-events-meta-value\"> Free </span>\n\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\n\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-meta-item\"><span class=\"tribe-events-event-categories-label tribe-events-meta-label\">Event Category:</span> <span class=\"tribe-events-event-categories tribe-events-meta-value\"><a href=\"/archive/source-6b76da6b8039efc6be67/\" rel=\"tag\">Guild of Harwich Artists</a></span></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events